WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,020
I'm stupid. Don't be afraid without you. I will help you get back why.

2
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,360
The fool is upset when he sees it

3
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,920
I don’t know if I’m being used yet

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,280
I thought you would join forces with him to deal with me first

5
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,440
Then I can't kill him anymore

6
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,280
Teammate Zhu will only drag me down. I agree.

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,580
So how much are you prepared to spend to bury your life?

8
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,280
I admit that this move hit a brick wall today.

9
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,960
But want my supplies

10
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,380
Then you must also have this ability

11
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,620
I didn't tell you it's non-toxic either.

12
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,100
You do have two brushes

13
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:44,970
If it had been anyone else, the poisonous weed would have taken hold, but it's a pity that it was me you met.
